OL,3,ADelays in fitting electronic tags
OL,4,Aputting victims at risk, report finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlmost half of electronic tags used to
OL,7,Ftrack offenders' movements are not
OL,8,Ffitted on time, with significant delays
OL,9,Fputting victims in England and Wales at
OL,10,Frisk, a report has found.
OL,12,FThe report by His Majesty's
OL,13,FInspectorate of Probation (HMIP) says
OL,14,Fsome criminals are waiting up to five
OL,15,Fmonths to be fitted with a tag, leading
OL,16,Fto repeated breaches of court and
OL,17,Fprison orders.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,0,100
