OL,3,ADelays in fitting electronic tags
OL,4,Aputting victims at risk, report finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FOnly 55% of GPS and radio frequency
OL,7,Ftags were fitted on time, while 60% of
OL,8,Falcohol monitoring tags were fitted
OL,9,Fpromptly, according to the report's
OL,10,Ffindings.
OL,12,FA Ministry of Justice spokesperson said
OL,13,Fthe government was delivering the
OL,14,F"biggest expansion of tagging in
OL,15,FBritish history" with #100 million in
OL,16,Ffunding.
